  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f35df62-f11a-4a7b-9124-868689ac12be",
    "name": "SignalRaven API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "SignalRaven monitors LinkedIn for the conversations that matter to your business, qualifies the people who engage against your ideal customer profile through 14 review gates, scores urgency from 1 to 10, and delivers a signal with who they are, why it matters, and an opener drafted from what they posted.\n\nThis collection covers the public v1 API: signals, one signal, sources, watchlist, and the workspace ICP.\n\n## Auth\n\nEvery request carries an OAuth 2.1 bearer token from auth.signalraven.ai. Register a client with POST /api/v1/register, complete the OAuth flow described at https://signalraven.ai/developers, then set the collection variable `token`. The collection sends it as `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` on every request.\n\n## Links\n\n- Docs: https://signalraven.ai/developers\n- Integrations: https://signalraven.ai/integrations\n- MCP server for Claude, ChatGPT and Cursor: https://signalraven.ai/mcp\n- Support: support@signalraven.ai"
  }
